## Surgery

::bg{location="surgery" time="night"}
::vfx{type="whiteout"}
@narrator: The doors hiss open onto the brightest room in the building. The operating lamp is on, trained on an empty table.
@narrator: On the instrument tray, laid out where the scalpels should be: a staff file, a wedding ring, and a name badge. A. CRANE, ORDERLY.
::fright{amount=2}
@nell{mono}: A.C. The syringe in the pharmacy. They were keeping him quiet. Then they stopped.
